  "solution": {
    "text": "The circuit diagram can be redrawn as \r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2015_phy_a8.png\">\r\n\r\nFor the loop $A B C D A$,\r\n$$\r\n+2-2 I^{\\prime}+2-2 I=0\r\n$$\r\nFor the loop $A B F E A$,\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{r}\r\n2-2 I+2-2\\left(I-I^{\\prime}\\right)=0 \\\\\r\n4-2 I-2 I+2 I^{\\prime}=0\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n4-4 I+2 I^{\\prime} &=0 \\\\\r\n2 &=2 I-I^{\\prime}\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\r\nFrom Eqs (i) and (in), we get\r\n$$\r\n2=2 I-I^{\\prime} \\cdot 2=I+I^{\\prime}\r\n$$\r\n$$\r\n4=3 I, I=4 / 3=1.33 \\mathrm{A}\r\n$$",
    "image": null
